| F1 | open | IMPORTANT | scripts/gen_installers.dart | ⚠️ important dart format violation in the line this pr adds repo gate invariant scripts gen installers dart 696 — the new ps banner fallback line is 101 chars the formatter splits it dart committed this pr for final line in install ps banner as yamllist install banner as yamllist dart format 3 14 0 wants for final line in install ps banner as yamllist install banner as yamllist dart format output none set exit if changed scripts gen installers dart fails on this tree the file is format clean on main so this pr introduces the drift format clean is a documented invariant agents md §quality gates analyze format clean docs agents quality gates md 44 enforced by the pre commit hook s self heal scripts pre commit 39 43 — the committed state implies the hook was bypassed not 🚨 because ci deliberately does not run dart format hook only extra docs agents quality gates md 34 — no ci job goes red fix is mechanical dart format scripts gen installers dart the test file s violations at lines 174 212 271 are pre existing on main not this pr s debt |

### How to answer

Add a `findingReview` block to `outputs/pr_review.json` (alongside `inlineComments`):

```json
{"findingReview": {
  "dispositions": [
    {"n": 1, "status": "fixed", "hunk": "<file:lines \u2014 the fixing hunk>"},
    {"n": 2, "status": "withdrawn", "reason": "<why this is not a defect>"},
    {"n": 3, "status": "re-introduced"}
  ],
  "confirmations": [
    {"proposedFor": 1, "same": true}
  ]
}}
```

Unconfirmed candidates become new identities (the merge bias is confirm-only); a genuinely new finding on a resolved item is expected to be raised again with new evidence.

